<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:#000000;line-height:1.2;">Welcome to Tenjin, <%= @user.forename %>!</h1>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;line-height:1.5;">You have been assigned as the school administrator for <strong><%= @user.school.name %></strong>.</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 8px;line-height:1.5;">Your username is: <strong><%= @user.login %></strong></p>

<p style="margin:0 0 24px;line-height:1.5;">An email will follow shortly which will let you reset your password. To get started, visit <a href="https://tenjin.outwood.com" style="color:#ef4035;text-decoration:none;">tenjin.outwood.com</a>.</p>

<hr style="border:none;border-top:2px solid #ef4035;margin:24px 0;">

<h2 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:18px;font-weight:900;color:#000000;">Setup</h2>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;line-height:1.5;">Watch the following video to show you how to set up Tenjin for your school and classes.</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 24px;"><a href="https://vimeo.com/372642684" style="color:#ef4035;text-decoration:none;">https://vimeo.com/372642684</a></p>

<hr style="border:none;border-top:2px solid #ef4035;margin:24px 0;">

<h2 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:18px;font-weight:900;color:#000000;">Google</h2>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;line-height:1.5;">If your students have been given Google accounts, they can link their accounts to Tenjin. This video shows you how:</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 24px;"><a href="https://vimeo.com/386684579" style="color:#ef4035;text-decoration:none;">https://vimeo.com/386684579</a></p>

<p style="margin:0;line-height:1.5;">Thanks for joining!</p>
